^{:go/end 98} (go/method DeriveKey "DeriveKey sends an AMD SEV-SNP guest request for key derivation. The\narguments represent guest provided request parameters, the VM Communication\nKey (see [SecretsPage.VMPCK]) payload and index for encrypting the request.\n" [^{:tag (* GHCB)} b ^{:tag (* KeyRequest)} req ^{:tag (slice byte)} key ^int index] :results [^{:tag (slice byte)} dk ^error err]
